    "hints": [
        {
            "content": "The side whose length we want to find, $\\blueE{\\overline{GH}}$, is the side opposite to the given angle, $\\angle I$. \n\nThe side whose length we know, $\\goldE{\\overline{HI}}$, is the side adjacent to the given angle.\n\n\n\n[[☃ image 1]]\n\nWe can use the ratio of these side lengths to calculate the length $\\blueE{GH}$.",
